def smallest_change(arr):
    changes = 0
    n = len(arr)

    for i in range(n // 2):
        if arr[i] != arr[n - 1 - i]:
            changes += 1

    return changes
```

This compares each element with its mirror-position counterpart. Every mismatched pair requires exactly one change, so their count is the minimum number of changes needed. Time complexity: `O(n)`.

